; pl-a-fix1177-01 - expression matrix, AmiBlitz3 test of
; tests/corpus/tests-exprmatrix/pl-A-fix1177-01.bas: 4 of its 4 cells
; the checks have the values of blitz2-ab3 -r in AB3 mode (the port's
; compiler with AmiBlitz3's libraries); AmiBlitz3's measured values of 4
; cells differ, the deviations of its cells (pl-a-fix1177-01.test.toml,
; docs/ab3/variant.md)
; generated by exprmatrix expect from
; tests/corpus/tests-exprmatrix/matrix.txt (tools/exprmatrix/README.md);
; do not edit
DEFTYPE .l gl
Statement pl{x.l}
  SHARED gl
  gl=x
End Statement
!TestCase{cells}
  vq.q=1.5
  pl{vq = 1.5} : !CheckEq{gl,-1,"pl-eq-q-cf-A"}
  pl{vq <> 1.5} : !CheckEq{gl,0,"pl-ne-q-cf-A"}
  pl{vq < 1.5} : !CheckEq{gl,0,"pl-lt-q-cf-A"}
  pl{vq >= 1.5} : !CheckEq{gl,-1,"pl-ge-q-cf-A"}
!EndTestCase
